{"text": " This thing is ranked number one on GitHub right now. It's completely free. And almost nobody has set this up yet. So here's the deal. It's called Rooflo. And basically what it does is it spins up 60 plus AI agents that all work together to build whatever you want. And they actually get better after every single run. Pretty freaking cool. So you've got queen agents that manage the teams and tactical agents that handle all the actual work. Researching, coding, testing, reviewing, all of it. And they all share a collective memory so they improve over time. But here's the thing that makes this insane. It figures out how complex your task is and routes it to the right model automatically. Simple task goes to a cheap model, complicated task goes to a powerful one. So you can cut your token usage by up to 50% and extend your cloud code usage by 250%. That's nuts. It's open source, completely free, and ranked number one on GitHub, not bad. Drop flow in the comments and I'll send you the full setup guide.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.64, "text": " This thing is ranked number one on GitHub right now.", "tokens": [50364, 639, 551, 307, 20197, 1230, 472, 322, 23331, 558, 586, 13, 50496], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1923306572516233, "compression_ratio": 1.7253086419753085, "no_speech_prob": 0.00417193491011858}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.64, "end": 3.64, "text": " It's completely free.", "tokens": [50496, 467, 311, 2584, 1737, 13, 50546], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1923306572516233, "compression_ratio": 1.7253086419753085, "no_speech_prob": 0.00417193491011858}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 3.64, "end": 5.6000000000000005, "text": " And almost nobody has set this up yet.", "tokens": [50546, 400, 1920, 5079, 575, 992, 341, 493, 1939, 13, 50644], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1923306572516233, "compression_ratio": 1.7253086419753085, "no_speech_prob": 0.00417193491011858}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 5